{"video":"tY5LIr8dTsA","lines":[{"t":[0,7.9],"en":"Donna, oh my god, I am so excited to see you here."},{"t":[7.9,10.1],"en":"These things are horrible when you're by yourself."},{"t":[12.3,13.3],"en":"What?"},{"t":[13.3,15.6],"en":"Do you know where you are right now?"},{"t":[15.6,16.6],"en":"We're in the jungle."},{"t":[16.6,18],"en":"There are no friends here."},{"t":[18,21.2],"en":"It's every woman for herself."},{"t":[21.2,22],"en":"You're joking, right?"},{"t":[22,23.6],"en":"Do I look like I'm joking?"},{"t":[23.6,26.4],"en":"Dating is a zero-sum game."},{"t":[26.4,30.1],"en":"If you get a man, I don't get that man."},{"t":[30.1,33.9],"en":"I'm here because of advice that you gave me to be more adventurous in my life."},{"t":[33.9,35.6],"en":"Here's some more advice."},{"t":[35.6,36.6],"en":"Beat it."},{"t":[38,39.7],"en":"Hi, I'm Anne."},{"t":[39.7,40.8],"en":"Brian."},{"t":[40.8,42.2],"en":"What's your occupation?"},{"t":[42.2,44.1],"en":"I'm a manager at a sporting goods store."},{"t":[44.1,45.1],"en":"No way, me too."},{"t":[45.1,45.8],"en":"Seriously?"},{"t":[45.8,46.3],"en":"Which one?"},{"t":[46.3,48.2],"en":"No, I'm not."},{"t":[48.2,51.2],"en":"I was just ribbing you."},{"t":[51.2,52.6],"en":"What are you drinking?"},{"t":[52.6,53.7],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[53.7,55.3],"en":"What?"},{"t":[55.3,56.3],"en":"Oh, I don't know."},{"t":[56.3,58],"en":"I couldn't hear you."},{"t":[58,61.6],"en":"So you just laughed and said, \"Yeah?\""},{"t":[61.6,62.2],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[62.2,63.2],"en":"Excuse us."},{"t":[64.9,66.9],"en":"That was the worst thing I've ever seen in my life."},{"t":[66.9,68.2],"en":"Did you grow up in the woods?"},{"t":[68.2,69.4],"en":"Are you Nell?"},{"t":[69.4,70.4],"en":"From the movie Nell?"},{"t":[70.4,72],"en":"I told you I'm rusty."},{"t":[73.3,74.3],"en":"All right, come with me."},{"t":[75.9,78],"en":"You always want to scribble the name."},{"t":[78,79.3],"en":"Make them read."},{"t":[79.3,80.6],"en":"Draw them in."},{"t":[80.6,82.2],"en":"Make them work for it."},{"t":[82.2,83.1],"en":"Right."},{"t":[83.1,84.5],"en":"Two shots of Janison."},{"t":[84.5,87],"en":"Don't make too much eye contact."},{"t":[87,90.4],"en":"You want to seem available, but not too available."},{"t":[90.4,90.9],"en":"Thanks."},{"t":[90.9,91.9],"en":"I think I'm good for now."},{"t":[91.9,92.6],"en":"I'm not going to."},{"t":[92.6,94],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[94,96],"en":"Because."},{"t":[96,97.5],"en":"All right."},{"t":[97.5,100.1],"en":"Let's do this."},{"t":[100.1,101],"en":"Cool."},{"t":[101,103.6],"en":"We'll see you around, maybe."},{"t":[103.6,105.4],"en":"That went better, right?"},{"t":[105.4,106.4],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[106.4,110.2],"en":"He did, however, proudly tell me that he beat herpes."},{"t":[110.2,111],"en":"I'm sorry, Donna."},{"t":[111,111.8],"en":"I'm going to go home."},{"t":[111.8,114.8],"en":"I just found out Andy's getting married."},{"t":[114.8,115.8],"en":"So?"},{"t":[115.8,117.6],"en":"So that's my ex-boyfriend."},{"t":[117.6,119.8],"en":"We were together for a really long time."},{"t":[119.8,121],"en":"All right."},{"t":[121,121.8],"en":"What?"},{"t":[121.8,122.6],"en":"What?"},{"t":[122.6,125.3],"en":"Listen, you are a hot, young doctor."},{"t":[125.3,126.6],"en":"I'm a nurse, actually."},{"t":[126.6,127.8],"en":"OK, I don't know you."},{"t":[127.8,129.6],"en":"But I do know that you can fix your attitude."},{"t":[129.6,131.4],"en":"Do you want to go home and feel sorry for yourself"},{"t":[131.4,133.2],"en":"about a man you didn't want to marry?"},{"t":[133.2,134.7],"en":"Or do you want to go talk to that cute boy"},{"t":[134.7,137.2],"en":"who has been looking at you and give him your number"},{"t":[137.2,141.4],"en":"before I throw him in my bins for myself?"},{"t":[141.4,142.4],"en":"Yes, sir."},{"t":[142.4,143],"en":"All right."}]}
